      "id": "claim_13a598b8029641f7923ce23b2c95419e",
      "statement": "The server graph is exposed to `langgraph dev` through a generated langgraph.json that references deepagents_code.server_graph:make_graph, whose factory reads ServerConfig.from_env(), resolves a model, assembles tools, and compiles the agent graph.",
